{1}{This plaque reads: "This ancient iron chest was unearthed in the lair of Bellerogrim.  It seems to be older even than the dragon itself.  No one has ever been able to open it."}{This plaque reads This ancient iron chest was unearthed in the lair of Bellerogrim.  It seems to be older even than the dragon itself.  No one has ever been able to open it."}{}{}{}{}

